## The financial concepts you must understand

1\. Net worth

\\(\text{Net worth}=\text{Assets}-\text{Liabilities}\\)

This measures your financial position at a point in time.

2\. Cash flow

\\(\text{Cash flow}=\text{Money in}-\text{Money out}\\)

Positive cash flow gives you more room to save, repay debt or invest.

3\. Compounding

Returns can generate further returns over time. Compounding can work against you too when interest accumulates on debt.

4\. Risk management

Never invest money you need for immediate essential expenses in volatile assets. Understand what you could lose before investing.

